| !Run for !ReelEdit (Reel Edit, a video editor for RISC OS, on MLT)
Set ReelEdit$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <ReelEdit$Dir>.!Sprites
| "|<" keeps <ReelEdit$Dir> unexpanded; UnixLib expands it when MLT opens a file
Set MLT_DATA /|<ReelEdit$Dir>/share/mlt-7
Set MLT_PROFILES_PATH /|<ReelEdit$Dir>/share/mlt-7/profiles/
Set MLT_PRESETS_PATH /|<ReelEdit$Dir>/share/mlt-7/presets
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Reel Edit needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Reel Edit needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
| Hardware acceleration: the VideoOverlay module (in !System on RISC OS 5);
| quiet if it's missing (then the picture is drawn in the window)
RMEnsure VideoOverlay 0.00 IfThere System:Modules.VideoOverlay Then RMLoad System:Modules.VideoOverlay
| Sound: SharedSoundBuffer and StreamManager (ssb.zip, from
| https://orac.co.uk/software/rdpclient/rdpclient.html) and SharedSound
| (part of RISC OS). Merged into !System they still have to be loaded:
| these do it (and are quiet if they're missing). As Reel's !Run.
RMEnsure SharedSound 1.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSound Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSound
RMEnsure StreamManager 0.03 IfThere System:Modules.StreamMan Then RMLoad System:Modules.StreamMan
RMEnsure SharedSoundBuffer 0.07 IfThere System:Modules.SSBuffer Then RMLoad System:Modules.SSBuffer
| about 25MB of code and 8MB of zeroed data; the heap is in dynamic areas
WimpSlot -min 40960K -max 40960K
Run <ReelEdit$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
